# Walking Ballista cast for X = 1 enters with one +1/+1 counter, and counters it enters with are counters put on it (CR 122.6,
# 614.1c), so both of Bot1's replacement effects apply: Hardened Scales' "that many plus one" and Doubling Season's "twice that
# many". Bot1, whose creature it is, chooses the order (CR 616.1, Hardened Scales' ruling), and after the first has applied the
# other is judged again on the changed event (CR 616.1f): Scales first makes 1 + 1 = 2, then the Season makes 4 - a 4/4. The
# other order makes three (hardened-scales-applied-after-doubling-season-makes-walking-ballista-for-one-a-three-three).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
